#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build, stage, promote and prune personal VPS releases on the host itself.

Runs as root on the VPS, normally from the GitHub Actions deploy workflow.
Promotion changes only the selected instance's release path; configuration,
secrets, site drop-ins, previews and state are preserved. Every promotion
drains work and writes a private matched checkpoint first. Prune deletes old
releases and checkpoints under a fixed retention rule, on single-instance
hosts only. Bootstrap builds the first release on a host without an instance,
from pinned downloads instead of an installed release.
"""
